WEBVTT

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:10.860
Oh, the sunset was so beautiful
that I took that one on a whim.

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:14.610
The contrast between the sunlight
and shadows is splendid, isn't it?

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.830
<i>Souma Sumire...</i>

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:20.120
<i>It's the same place where we first met.</i>

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:22.040
<i>There was also the MacGuffin...</i>

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:23.790
<i>Why did she have it?</i>

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:36.390
Hey...

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:39.970
Hey, you!

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:45.060
Are you crying?

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:48.520
Why would you think that?

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:53.530
I figured it'd make you answer me.

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.990
Unfortunately, I'm not really
in the mood to talk to anyone.

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:02.120
How come?

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:04.830
I dunno. Why do you think?

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.790
Because the sunset is really beautiful?

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:10.380
Yeah, that's exactly right.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:36.780
Now, you've lost your reason
for not wanting to talk to anyone.

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:38.410
That's true.

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:40.530
What do you want?

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:44.910
Why do you think there are
tetrapods in a place like this?

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:47.670
Were you waiting this whole time
just to ask me about that?

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:49.790
Well, doesn't it make you wonder?

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:54.590
Isn't it because there's a river
with a beautiful sunset here?

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:56.920
Is that a reason?

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:59.800
Well, I kinda like the sunset here.

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.180
I like it, too.

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:05.680
It's sort of like a scene out of a story.

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:11.440
I think it's wonderful when a boy and girl
make a promise to each other in such a place.

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:13.150
That doesn't sound half bad.

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:17.150
Why don't we promise something?

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:20.530
The sun's already set.

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:22.990
Let's meet again, Asai.

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:25.500
Is that our promise?

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:30.000
It will be, if you agree to it.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:46.770
It's August 7th. The time is 11:49:32.

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:50.770
Looks like we've reset.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.360
What happened?

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:54.110
All sorts of things.

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:56.230
If I were to sum it up, there's about three things.

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:01.780
I used my reset ability for those things?

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.530
Do you remember Oka Eri?

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:06.660
She's one year below us.

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.040
She used to be Fujikawa Eri.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:11.920
Her parents got divorced two years ago,
so her last name changed.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:14.000
She didn't possess any ability at that time.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.750
I remember.

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:19.130
She was the girl who was afraid of her violent dad.

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:23.430
<i>I hate Fujikawa Eri.</i>

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:25.050
<i>She's weak and worthless.</i>

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:26.890
<i>I absolutely hate Fujikawa Eri.</i>

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:31.230
<i>My dad was strict.
He'd get mad at me no matter what I did.</i>

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:34.020
The flow of time makes a continuous sound (so close your eyes and feel it)

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:37.780
My mom always sided with me,
but all she could do was cry.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:38.650
It's a melody that invites the coming future (which begins today)

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:42.320
But then one day, he saved me.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:43.070
It's a melody that invites the coming future (which begins today)

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:44.070
What's your mother's maiden name?

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:45.200
What kind of world is waiting for me? (Who is calling me?)

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.740
It's Oka.

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:50.000
I'll call you Oka Eri, then.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:50.580
Huh?
What kind of world is waiting for me? (Who is calling me?)

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:54.290
I tried asking myself for an answer (in my heart)
It's a very nice name, isn't it? "Oka Eri"...

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:57.840
It's not really dainty, it sort of seems like a joke,
I tried asking myself for an answer (in my heart)

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:57.920
Here, in the middle of ideals and reality (I'm searching for them)
It's not really dainty, it sort of seems like a joke,

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:00.340
and it won't make you feel troubled at all.
Here, in the middle of ideals and reality (I'm searching for them)

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.470
It's a strong, brazen name.
Here, in the middle of ideals and reality (I'm searching for them)

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:02.840
Here, in the middle of ideals and reality (I'm searching for them)

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.390
It's good that it doesn't suit you at all right now.

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:06.430
The hands of the clock are being constantly moved (as I turn them back)

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:08.760
Take up the name Oka Eri.

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:11.430
You should ditch your father
and the Fujikawa name.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:12.100
I'll do anything to erase all sadness (over and over again)

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.940
Your father leaked some information.
I'll do anything to erase all sadness (over and over again)

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:15.230
I'll do anything to erase all sadness (over and over again)

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:17.770
It's information that should never be leaked, you know.

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:17.900
Even if it means going back down the passage of dark stairs (to recreate the past)

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:22.150
For example, you should try telling him that you'll send this to the Bureau.

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:24.240
Isn't that a bad thing to do?
Even if it means going back down the passage of dark stairs (to recreate the past)

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:25.490
There's something I want to protect no matter what (I'll protect you)
Isn't that a bad thing to do?

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:28.280
Bad? Of course it is!
There's something I want to protect no matter what (I'll protect you)

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:30.540
I'm telling you to threaten your father.
There's something I want to protect no matter what (I'll protect you)

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:31.450
I'll say that out loud (and try resetting again)
I'm telling you to threaten your father.

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:32.540
I'll say that out loud (and try resetting again)

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:33.790
You must decide for yourself on what to do.
I'll say that out loud (and try resetting again)

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:35.580
Believing that fate will bring us together again
You must decide for yourself on what to do.

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:36.000
Believing that fate will bring us together again

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:40.090
I'm gonna be a strong,
wicked person like you, Asai Kei.
Believing that fate will bring us together again

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:43.590
I'll become Oka Eri.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.980
Looks like I'm going the right way.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.480
Tsushima Shintarou

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:05.780
The person you're investigating is Oka Eri,
the third-year from Nanasaka Middle School, right?

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:06.780
Yes.

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:09.660
She's probably affiliated with the Bureau.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:14.750
Lately, a Bureau staff member has started
utilizing the abilities of a person called Oka Eri.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:20.250
Does that mean Oka Eri sealed Mr. Sasano's
ability under the Bureau's orders?

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:24.050
I still don't know.
I've sorta got a bad feeling about this.

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:27.760
Did you find out anything about her ability?

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:30.010
Not yet. We ran into a bit of trouble.

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:32.270
Is someone hiding it?

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:34.020
There's a high possibility.

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:37.650
Well, I'll probably learn something
once I find out a little more.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:40.860
Also, I think you already know,
but I'll say it just in case:

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:41.770
Second Time
Tuesday
August 8th

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:42.820
Be careful out there.
Second Time
Tuesday
August 8th

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.610
Second Time
Tuesday
August 8th

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.990
Are you going to see Oka Eri?

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:48.780
Yeah.

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:51.700
I feel like I need to speak with
her first before anything else.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:56.040
I reasked Murase the favor,
so she's looking for her for me.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.670
Will that improve the situation?

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:00.420
I'm not sure.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:03.210
It'd be nice if it's the sort of problem
I can resolve with just an apology.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:05.550
I have just one question.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:10.470
Kei, if I were to ever lose my ability to reset,

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:13.970
will that change anything about our relationship?

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:18.730
I don't know.

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:22.980
If you're unsure, I swear I won't ever lose my ability.

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.900
It's been about 24 hours.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:31.870
Save.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:42.630
<i>That outfit... That's probably Oka Eri.</i>

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:44.340
Huh?

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:46.710
Murase Youka?

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:50.930
You want one?

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.090
No, I don't.

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:54.640
What? But I split it in half already.

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:57.680
How do you know my name?

00:06:57.680 --> 00:07:00.520
Because I'm doing an investigation on Asai.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:03.650
And I more or less know what
happened between you and him.

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:07.860
But I wonder why Murase Youka is here.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:10.070
I was looking for you.

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:12.410
So they did a reset, huh?

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:14.120
How do you...

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:16.330
It's simple.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:20.160
There's no reason for his associate
to look for me right now.

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:23.420
Which means that the cause
could only lie in the future.

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:26.840
Why are you doing his dirty work?

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:28.300
It's not like that.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:32.890
He's not the kind of guy you'd
team up with or befriend, right?

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:34.850
Why would you care?

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.770
That's not good, not good at all.

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:40.100
Asai Kei isn't like that.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:44.440
He has to be a more egocentric, selfish villain.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:45.980
What are you trying to say?

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:48.900
As he is now, he's become far too weak.

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.320
Seeing him like that pisses me off.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:54.200
At the very least, Asai is stronger than you.

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:56.990
You're adorable!

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:59.370
I like how you glare at people when you're angry.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:00.960
What the hell does that mean?

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:02.330
Nothing.

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:09.340
It's just... Well, I should probably
prove Asai's weakness soon.

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:24.560
Hello.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.110
Hello.

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:30.030
How many years has it been?

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:32.320
A little over 28 years.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.610
Today is August 8th.

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:36.820
I see. It's almost time, then.

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:40.290
Our promise will be fulfilled soon.

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:43.330
May I see your future?

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:44.420
Please go right ahead.

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:58.100
Are there any problems?

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:01.720
No. There are no major ones.

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:02.430
But...

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:03.600
But?

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:08.520
The Bureau noticed that you're
able to go into photographs.

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:09.480
How?

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.320
I don't know.

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:16.450
I'm sure something happened
that made him more wary of you.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:22.450
Around three o'clock today,
a girl will come by to collect all of your photos.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.210
That's not good.

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:25.750
It's okay.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:28.790
Even if you lose your photos, our plans won't change.

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.800
It'd be best not to put up a fight.

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:39.510
As things are right now,
it will end up going just as planned.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:40.510
Huh?

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:45.350
Do you want to see the real me again no matter what?

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:46.810
Of course I do!

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:50.230
Even if it means making someone else unhappy?

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:52.610
Even if it's bad for us to reunite?

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:58.990
For me, good and evil hold no meaning
in a world without you.

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:01.950
All right.

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:06.660
Send the photos I'll specify
now before they're collected.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:08.370
Send them? To whom?

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.540
To Asai Kei.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:11.500
Help me!

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:13.000
Murase?

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:16.050
Please, help me! Come right away!

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:18.380
Got it. Where are you?

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:20.010
I'm at a store in front of the station.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:21.510
Where are you?!

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:23.430
I'm at the café where we first met.

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:24.770
I'll head over right away.

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:26.310
I'll head to you too!

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:29.900
Something came up. Pay the bill with this.

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:30.900
I'm going, too.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.730
I'm sorry, but I'm going alone.

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:53.040
Nice to meet you, Haruki.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:55.130
Hey, now! Aren't you being rude?

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:00.470
There's no point in hiding there.

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:05.680
You sure are confident!

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.900
But I also pride myself in never
holding back when needed!

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:20.910
Man, the basket on my bike
got dented 'cause I fell down.

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:24.370
I kinda liked this bike, you know.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:27.040
But not as much as these contacts.

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.370
These are custom-made.

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:31.250
There's something faintly written here.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.880
Can you see it? Look, right here.

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:39.050
Take a good look.

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:42.760
Murase!

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:43.720
Asai!

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:47.930
What happened?

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.350
No one followed you here, right?

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:52.810
As much as I glanced around, it seemed like no one did.

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.440
Be more specific!

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:56.520
There isn't anything scary around?

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:59.030
Anything scary? Like what?

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:00.820
Like a monkey!

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:02.660
A monkey followed you?!

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:07.200
It followed me,
or I guess I should say it stared at me.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:09.700
Anyway, there is no monkey.

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:10.910
Really?

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:12.670
Really.

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:14.380
Please take a look behind you.

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.800
There isn't one, huh?

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:23.130
Yes. There isn't a monkey in sight.

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:26.970
Just a little while ago, I met Oka Eri.

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:28.260
And?

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:30.930
And... I don't really know.

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:35.730
In any case, I was so scared
that I felt I just had to call you.

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:38.440
But my memories are all scattered.

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:39.900
What about the monkey?

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.780
The monkey looked at me.

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:44.740
Its head was split open above its brows.

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.780
It was bleeding, and I could see its brains...

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:48.160
I was so scared.

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:50.660
Did you get all of that?

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:52.080
I did.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:53.330
Did you really get it?

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:56.210
Typically, you'd say something
impossible happened, right?

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:59.670
Then we can assume that it's someone's ability.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:01.420
Are you saying it's Oka Eri's ability?

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:07.300
I'm guessing Oka Eri's ability is the type
that can tamper with one's mind.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:10.180
But there are some things I just don't understand.

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:17.150
Hello?

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:18.610
Hey there!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.570
I took Haruki Misora's reset ability.

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:24.530
I completely took it away!

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:29.620
Oka Eri, please keep Haruki out of this.

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:32.450
Hell no. There's no point if I don't do this.

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:35.120
I want to prove your weakness.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:37.170
Prove my weakness?

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:40.840
If you want her reset ability back,
then hand over the MacGuffin.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:41.960
Okay.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:44.800
Well, let's see here...
Nighttime would probably be best.

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.840
Let's meet up tonight at nine o'clock.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:47.890
Where at?

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.470
I haven't decided yet. I'll get back to you later.

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:53.970
I'm returning this.

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:55.140
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.100
It's nothing at all.

00:13:57.100 --> 00:14:00.310
I'm not hurting anywhere anymore.

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.360
I'm sorry, Kei.

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:04.360
No, it's my fault.

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:07.320
Please give me orders to reset.

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:11.870
I'm begging you.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:14.700
Please do what you believe
is the most appropriate thing to do.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:18.460
Hold on for just a moment.

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:28.090
Haruki, reset.

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:29.380
Reset.

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:33.100
It looks like I really can't do it.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:37.430
Let's try something else.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:41.190
Right hand. Oka Eri's ability.

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.230
Haruki, reset.

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:45.530
Reset.

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:50.780
I'm sorry. I really can't use my ability, after all.

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:52.620
I see.

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:56.620
I beg of you, Kei. Please restore my reset ability.

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:59.040
Yeah. That's what I was planning to do.

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:00.870
I swear I'll get it back.

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:03.090
But what are you going to do?

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:07.840
First, I'll meet with Mr. Tsushima,
and I'll ask him for details on Oka Eri's ability.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:11.090
Also, I've got a favor to ask, Murase.

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:12.970
You sure are shameless.

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:15.810
I <i>am</i> pretty selfish.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:21.310
You become friends with girls
before you realize, Kei.

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:25.150
It'd be good for you to make
some more friends, too.

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:28.150
Do you mean male friends?

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:34.030
It doesn't matter what gender,
but it'd be more fun to see you talking to girls.

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:36.120
Who do you recommend in that regard?

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.200
Nonoh, maybe?

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:42.170
I'll do what I can.

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:46.880
Hey, Oka Eri.

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:49.800
Don't call me Oka Eri! We're not that chummy.

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:51.760
Were you able to dispose of the photos?

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:53.300
I will now.

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.640
Why are we burning the photos after all this time?

00:15:56.640 --> 00:16:00.890
Because things that shouldn't be recreated
with his ability are in those photographs.

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:03.980
Even though I sealed Sasano's ability?

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:06.270
He had lied about it.

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:07.110
Lied?

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:12.950
We discovered that Sasano's ability
is used when he takes photos.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:17.910
As long as he has photos that he took with his ability,
he can go into them even with his ability sealed.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:23.710
How stupid! To think the Bureau
would get an ability wrong!

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:27.170
Even despite claiming to have someone
who knows the future, too.

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:30.130
That's true. She is exceptional.

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:33.510
But I guess no one told you yet.

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:36.720
She's going to die soon.

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:37.970
For real?

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:44.230
Yeah. If you want her ability,
it'd be best for you to act quickly.

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:47.650
Sorry I'm late.

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.440
No, I should apologize.

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.360
I'm sorry for making you come out here.

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:54.360
Things seem to be getting rather complicated, huh?

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:56.820
Yes, in their own way.

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:59.660
What do you think Oka Eri's ability is?

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:04.870
I think she has an ability
that's similar to brainwashing.

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:07.290
Maybe one that manipulates memory.

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:08.920
Why do you think that?

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:12.880
Before the reset, she didn't use her ability on me.

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:16.970
I'm guessing it might be an ability
that's difficult to use on me.

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:17.720
You're correct.

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:21.060
Here's information on Oka Eri's ability.

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.310
Thank you very much.

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:28.270
Her ability appears to be one
that adds and subtracts memories.

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:32.860
The adding effect works by planting a fake memory.

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:39.870
If she plants a vague mental image, the person will
create a memory based on that image on their own.

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:42.290
That's how Murase was shown a monkey.

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:45.210
She can even specify actions to some extent.

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:47.960
For example, she can manipulate
your memories to the point

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:52.420
you think it isn't just a looming danger,
but you actually feel the need to run away.

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:56.260
The effect Haruki is under is probably the other one.

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:58.930
You mean, the ability that subtracts memories?

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:00.930
The ability that makes you forget something.

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:04.430
Haruki has forgotten how to use her ability.

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:09.190
That's true. Right now,
I can't remember how I used to reset.

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:11.320
What should I do to remember?

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:15.650
There are three weaknesses to Oka Eri's ability.

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:20.570
Firstly, she needs to lock eyes with you for
at least five seconds in order for it to work.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:26.290
Secondly, even though her ability
can do a lot, it's very easy to overcome.

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:31.040
If you're able to pinpoint it from the outside,
the correct memory will come to you.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:34.920
So I'll be able to remember
how to use my reset ability?

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:38.300
It's theoretically possible,
but it's impossible in reality.

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:43.640
You were the only person in the world who
knew how to use the reset ability, Haruki.

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:46.890
No one around you can tell you the correct answer.

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:51.360
You can expect the ability-sealing
to be a permanent effect.

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:53.400
And what's the third weakness?

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:58.530
Oka Eri's ability only has one type
of effect on each person.

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:03.870
If she uses her ability on someone
she's already used it on,

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:05.830
the previous effect disappears.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:08.540
Will it work out?

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:14.170
I'm not sure yet, but it's still better than
my previous assumptions about her ability.

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:19.090
Hey there.

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:20.970
I've decided on the stage for tonight.

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:23.640
The lighthouse visible from our middle school library.

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:24.850
Remember?

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:26.600
Yeah. Of course.

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:56.040
Hey there. Long time.

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:58.760
It's been a long time, huh?

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:02.430
You were a hero to me, you know.

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:04.680
You're the one who saved me.

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:09.890
I believe that you were right.

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.850
I always have, even now.

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:17.730
I believe that when you first appeared in my life,
you were more right than anyone else.

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:21.450
But I think I was wrong.

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:26.320
I admired my hero, so I'm trying to become one.

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:29.200
But the main hero is denying that.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:30.540
That's a cruel betrayal.

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:32.660
No matter how villainous you are, that's no good.

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:35.500
It's a bit too savage.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.670
Sorry.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:40.670
But I can't accept who I was two years ago.

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:43.970
I shouldn't have denied Fujikawa Eri.

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:49.140
Even with the name Fujikawa Eri, there should've
been a way for you to become happy.

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:54.980
I never wanted that. I'm glad I became Oka Eri.

00:20:55.230 --> 00:21:00.780
Even so, you shouldn't have picked a method
that made you carry all the responsibility alone.

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:01.860
You're wrong.

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:05.820
Taking responsibility is what strength is.
Avoiding it is a sign of weakness!

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:09.740
I'm strong. It's okay if it's all my fault.

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:13.580
I'm going to get stronger.
I'm going to become a brazen villain!

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:17.000
I'm fine with living in a way that only
a strong person would understand.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:18.630
Those were your words, weren't they?!

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:20.000
Don't you dare deny any of it!

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:24.010
You won't accept Fujikawa Eri, no matter what?

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:27.510
Don't call me by that name ever again.

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:30.640
Okay. That's fine.

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:34.770
Oh? I thought you were going to deny,
acting all hypocritical.

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:38.150
Now, I'm going to take the MacGuffin
away from you in a magnificent way.

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:40.900
I'll give it to you.

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:44.650
Are you messing with me? It's a fake, isn't it?!

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:45.490
It's the real deal.

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:49.450
There, you've got the MacGuffin.

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:51.330
That means you've accomplished
what you set out to do.

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:54.700
Wrong. I'm going to beat you!

00:21:54.700 --> 00:21:59.290
I want you to understand that you're
worthless and not even worth my time!

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:01.670
But that's already impossible.

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:06.420
That's not true.
I'll easily take the MacGuffin from you!

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:09.550
Yeah, you can easily take this away.

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:12.760
You're so unfair.

00:22:12.760 --> 00:22:14.310
I think so, too.

00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:20.230
I see.

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:25.780
Let's change the rules a bit
so that you'll actually get serious.

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:28.280
I can see everything in plain sight from here.

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:31.580
I know that Haruki Misora is trailing behind you.

00:22:32.700 --> 00:22:35.000
This is the new rule.

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:39.080
I'm going to plant a memory into
Haruki Misora that she'll absolutely hate.

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:41.040
You're going to prevent that from happening.

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:44.090
That's pointless.
Your memory manipulation is easy to overcome.

00:22:44.420 --> 00:22:47.920
If she's able to pinpoint it,
she'll realize that it's wrong.

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:52.470
Just by noticing that it's wrong,
the memory itself will continue to remain.

00:22:52.470 --> 00:22:56.220
If you still don't mind,
you can watch right here from the sidelines.

00:22:57.140 --> 00:22:59.190
Bye-bye.

00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:06.780
Where am I?

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:11.490
Could this be a world within the picture?

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:13.200
Mr. Sasano's ability...

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:15.700
NO TRESPASSING

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:16.450
Who's there?
NO TRESPASSING

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:17.910
Hey there!

00:23:19.620 --> 00:23:21.750
I've got Asai Kei.

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:24.790
You're next.

00:23:27.460 --> 00:23:30.630
A story of a witch who rode on a broom, flying through
the sky to knock on the window of her beloved's room.

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:31.760
But that's no good.

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:32.640
I don't believe that Kei would ever lose to you.
But that's no good.

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:33.140
I don't believe that Kei would ever lose to you.

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:34.010
This is a future I didn't see.
I don't believe that Kei would ever lose to you.

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:34.970
This is a future I didn't see.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:35.640
I think I was summoned by you.
This is a future I didn't see.

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:36.140
I think I was summoned by you.

00:23:36.140 --> 00:23:37.430
In that case, I'll take all of your memories!
I think I was summoned by you.

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:38.640
In that case, I'll take all of your memories!

00:23:38.640 --> 00:23:39.020
I don't want to reset.
In that case, I'll take all of your memories!

00:23:39.020 --> 00:23:41.020
I don't want to reset.

00:23:41.520 --> 00:23:48.650
We're always simply standing in a rain of eternal sadness

00:23:48.650 --> 00:23:56.160
That is why I need that warmth of yours

00:23:56.740 --> 00:24:01.620
Life is but a dream we never wake up from

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:09.670
We repeat it over and over, praying for salvation

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:15.260
I kept waiting endlessly for your signal

00:24:16.220 --> 00:24:22.480
To make sure you wouldn't disappear all by yourself

00:24:23.020 --> 00:24:26.980
Ah, it doesn't matter where I am or what I'm doing

00:24:26.980 --> 00:24:30.690
My heart can't go against your will

00:24:30.690 --> 00:24:36.320
So I'd follow you even to the ends of the world

00:24:36.320 --> 00:24:43.460
I fell in love with you at the dawn of our new world

00:24:43.460 --> 00:24:50.090
But we kept pushing the hand of the clock backwards

00:24:50.090 --> 00:24:57.140
And lost not only time, but our smiles as well

00:24:57.140 --> 00:25:01.220
You're the one who brought it back

00:25:01.220 --> 00:25:08.110
And taught me that even lies can be meaningful
